  "readme": "## README.md\n# Hex Fused-partitioned datasets\n\n## Overview\n\nThis repository contains re-paritioned and hex indexed version of:\n- Crop Data Layer (`fused/hex/release_2025_04_beta/cdl/`)\n- US Census data  (`fused/hex/release_2025_04_beta/census/`)\n\n<img src=\"https://data.source.coop/fused/hex/docs/banner.png\" alt=\"Banner image showing Census + CDL\" width=\"100%\"/>\n\n## Quickstart\n\n### Open Datasets in Fused\n\n**Explore parquet metadata**\n\nAccess to this dataset is facilitated by the [Fused](https://www.fused.io/) platform. Browse the data on [Fused Workbench](https://www.fused.io/workbench/catalog/CDL_from_source_coop-d6f88129-73e3-469b-8ac4-7793c2acbeed).\n\n**Query dataset directly**\n\n## Details\n\n[Fused](https://www.fused.io/) is providing these datasets as hex versions in both `hex7` and `hex8` resolutions.\n\nYou can explore the CDL data with one of our [public UDF](https://www.fused.io/workbench/catalog/CDL_from_source_coop-d6f88129-73e3-469b-8ac4-7793c2acbeed) at no cost. \n\n**Crop Data Layer**\n\n- Available for `[2012, 2014, 2016, 2018, 2020, 2022, 2024]`\n- Available in `hex7` and `hex8` resolutions\n\n**US Census Data**\n\n- Available for 2020\n- Available in `hex7` and `hex8` resolutions\n\n## Original Dataset\n\n**Crop Data Layer**\n\nData gathered from [the USDA CDL Download page](https://pdi.scinet.usda.gov/portal/apps/sites/#/cropcros/pages/download-data)\n\n**US Census Data**\n\nData gathered from [2020 TIGER/Line Shapefile dataset on census.gov](https://www.census.gov/geographies/mapping-files/time-series/geo/tiger-line-file.2020.html#list-tab-790442341)\n\n\n## Citation\n\nCropland Data Layer from [USDA CroplandCros](https://pdi.scinet.usda.gov/portal/apps/sites/#/cropcros):\n\n```\nUSDA National Agricultural Statistics Service Cropland Data Layer. 2025. Published crop-specific data layer [Online]. Available at https://croplandcros.scinet.usda.gov/ (accessed 2025; verified 2025). USDA-NASS, Washington, DC.\n```\n\nUS Census from [data.census.org](https://data.census.gov/):\n\n```\nU.S. Census Bureau, \"TIGER/Line Shapefiles\", <https://www.census.gov/geographies/mapping-files/time-series/geo/tiger-line-file.2020.html#list-tab-790442341>, accessed on April 29, 2025.\n```",
